[list]
[*]Marked as supporting RimWorld 1.7, so 1.7's mod list no longer shows Apparel Painter in yellow as potentially unsupported. The mod itself runs on 1.7 unchanged.
[*]The mod no longer ships its regression test suite, or the -apparelpainter-harness launch option that started it. Both are developer tooling and do not belong in a player's install, and the mod's assembly is 20 KB smaller without them. Painting, restyling, the picker and every supported stand and storage behave exactly as in 1.1.0.
[/list]
